BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pergolesi's Stabat Mater
DTSTART:20261017T150000
DTEND:20261017T164500
DTSTAMP:20261017T141651Z
UID:0ae680dfb31bec424bfb9e50393463@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Dynamic Artistic Director Filippo Ciabatti leads UVB’s world
 -class orchestra on period instruments\, featuring soloists Chelsea Helm (
 soprano) and Cody Bowers (countertenor). Giovanni Pergolesi’s Stabat Mat
 er offers a profound meditation on grief\, empathy\, and love. This iconic
  work will be paired with dramatic opera excerpts by another master of the
  Italian Baroque vocal style – George Frideric Handel. Also will be perf
 ormed: Fri Oct 16 (7pm) @ Marlboro and Sun Oct 18 (3pm) @ Lebanon Opera Ho
 use.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Chandler Center for the Arts\, 71 N. Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/pergolesis
 -stabat-mater-01-10-2026-07-31-25
