BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pies on the Porch
DTSTART:20261017T130000
DTEND:20261017T150000
DTSTAMP:20261017T141651Z
UID:f97e90df88a081350748736c0407fa@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a slice of homemade pie and explore local history throug
 h exhibits and collections featuring period furnishings and kitchen items
